# Keep the Docker build context lean and deterministic (apps/api/Dockerfile
# builds from the repo root). node_modules exclusion also protects the
# symlink forests the deps stages copy in from being clobbered by COPY of
# the workspace dirs during local builds.
.git
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.turbo
docs
*.png
*.md
apps/web
